OL,3,GNEWSAWales to make #100 energy payments
OL,4,Abut Plaid ministers say Budget leaves
OL,5,Athem with cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Healey's spending package led to a
OL,8,Fdisagreement over the state of funding
OL,9,Ffor Wales' public services, with Jones
OL,10,Fsaying an extra #450m over three years
OL,11,Fworked out at a "real-terms cut"
OL,12,Fbecause it was below the rate of annual
OL,13,Finflation.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
